OL,3,GNEWSASeries goes behind the scenes at
OL,4,Amajor trauma unit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new BBC Two documentary series
OL,7,Ffollows staff at Southmead Hospital's
OL,8,Femergency department as they deal with
OL,9,Feverything from car crashes and
OL,10,Fstabbings, to third-degree burns.
OL,12,FThe six-part show, Emergency 24/7,
OL,13,Flooks at the everyday pressures and
OL,14,Fcomplex teamwork required to run the
OL,15,Fhospital's adult Major Trauma Centre
OL,16,F(MTC), a specialist regional unit.
OL,18,FIt follows staff as they care for
OL,19,Fpatients, from their initial arrival in
OL,20,Fthe emergency department, through
OL,21,Fdiagnosis and treatment.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
